  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "H. Howard Flint II was an American printing-ink executive who led his family’s company through international expansion. Joining Flint Ink when annual sales were modest, he became its third-generation chairman and chief executive. He helped build a billion-dollar global supplier of inks and pigments before the business was sold to XSYS Print Solutions.",
